    <briefdescription>
<para>Deprecated generic strongly-typed wrapper for explicit type conversion. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <computeroutput><ref refid="structmicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1__t" kindref="compound">_t</ref></computeroutput> template provides a public, strongly-typed wrapper for any type <computeroutput>T</computeroutput>, enabling explicit conversion of dynamic values and expressions to a type recognised by the µTest++ comparators and reporting mechanisms.</para>
<para>This wrapper inherits from <computeroutput><ref refid="structmicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1type__traits_1_1value" kindref="compound">type_traits::value</ref>&lt;T&gt;</computeroutput>, ensuring that the encapsulated value is treated as the specified type within the framework.</para>
<para><xrefsect id="deprecated_1_deprecated000024"><xreftitle>Deprecated</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>Use <computeroutput><ref refid="structmicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1to__t" kindref="compound">to_t</ref></computeroutput> (since 3.2.0).</para>
</xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>
    </detaileddescription>
